2
00:00:00,001 --> 00:05:01,000
Step into Dreams

3
00:05:54,308 --> 00:05:59,308
大空スバル 3周記念ライブ「ふれんどあーす！」
Oozora Subaru 3rd Anniversary Live: Friend Earth!

4
00:06:29,308 --> 00:06:32,308
3周年ありがとう！これからもずっと君と一緒に！
Thank you for the 3rd anniversary! I want to be with you forever!

5
00:06:37,308 --> 00:06:39,308
ホロライブに入る！！
I will join Hololive!!

6
00:06:43,308 --> 00:06:46,308
オーディション会場
Audition Venue

7
00:07:45,308 --> 00:07:46,608
あぁ
Ah...

8
00:07:46,608 --> 00:07:49,108
いつものように
Just like always,

9
00:07:49,108 --> 00:07:52,608
過ぎる日々に あくびが出る
I yawn at the passing days.

10
00:07:52,608 --> 00:07:56,108
さんざめく夜 超え今日も
Crossing the bustling night, today again,

11
00:07:56,108 --> 00:07:59,608
渋谷の街に朝が降る
morning falls on the streets of Shibuya.

12
00:07:59,608 --> 00:08:02,908
どこか虚しいような そんな気持ち
Somehow feeling empty, that kind of feeling...

13
00:08:02,908 --> 00:08:06,208
つまらないな でもそれでいい
It's boring, but that's fine.

14
00:08:06,208 --> 00:08:09,708
そんなもんさ これでいい
That's just how it is. This is fine.

15
00:08:09,708 --> 00:08:13,208
知らず知らず隠してた
The real voice that I had been hiding,

16
00:08:13,208 --> 00:08:16,908
本当の声を響かせてよ ほら
unconsciously, let it resonate, look!

17
00:08:16,908 --> 00:08:20,308
見ないフリしていても
Even if you pretend not to see it,

18
00:08:20,308 --> 00:08:23,808
確かにそこにある
it is certainly there.

19
00:08:23,808 --> 00:08:25,308
あぁ
Ah...

20
00:08:25,308 --> 00:08:28,708
感じたままに描く
Drawing just as I feel,

21
00:08:28,708 --> 00:08:32,108
自分で選んだその色で
with the color that I chose myself.

22
00:08:32,108 --> 00:08:35,308
眠い空気纏う朝に
In the morning clad in drowsy air,

23
00:08:35,308 --> 00:08:38,708
訪れた青い世界
a blue world has arrived.

24
00:08:38,708 --> 00:08:42,108
好きなものを好きだと言う
Saying that I like what I like,

25
00:08:42,108 --> 00:08:45,508
怖くて仕方ないけど
it's so scary I can't help it, but...

26
00:08:45,508 --> 00:08:50,108
本当の自分 出会えた気がしたんだ
I felt like I was able to meet my true self.

27
00:09:00,108 --> 00:09:01,308
あぁ
Ah...

28
00:09:01,308 --> 00:09:04,108
手を伸ばせば伸ばすほどに
The more I reach out my hand,

29
00:09:04,108 --> 00:09:06,708
遠くへゆく
the further away it goes.

30
00:09:06,708 --> 00:09:10,308
思うようにいかない今日も
Even today, when things don't go as planned,

31
00:09:10,308 --> 00:09:13,808
また慌ただしくもがいてる
I'm struggling busily again.

32
00:09:13,808 --> 00:09:16,208
悔しい気持ちも
Even these frustrating feelings,

33
00:09:16,208 --> 00:09:19,708
ただ情けなくて涙が出る
just make me feel miserable and cry.

34
00:09:19,708 --> 00:09:23,108
踏み込むほどに 苦しくなる
The more I step forward, the harder it gets,

35
00:09:23,108 --> 00:09:26,808
痛くもなる
and the more it hurts.

36
00:09:26,808 --> 00:09:28,308
あぁ
Ah...

37
00:09:28,308 --> 00:09:31,708
感じたままに進む
Moving forward just as I feel,

38
00:09:31,708 --> 00:09:35,108
自分で選んだこの道を
on this path that I chose myself.

39
00:09:35,108 --> 00:09:38,508
重いまぶた擦る夜に
On the night when I rub my heavy eyelids,

40
00:09:38,508 --> 00:09:41,908
しがみついた青い誓い
the blue vow I clung onto.

41
00:09:41,908 --> 00:09:45,308
好きなことを続けること
Continuing to do what I love,

42
00:09:45,308 --> 00:09:48,708
それは楽しいだけじゃない
isn't just fun all the time.

43
00:09:48,708 --> 00:09:53,308
本当にできる？ 不安になるけど<
Can I really do it? I get anxious, but...

44
00:09:53,308 --> 00:09:54,908
あぁ 何枚でも
Ah, no matter how many pages...

45
00:09:54,908 --> 00:09:56,508
ほら 何枚でも
Look, no matter how many pages...

46
00:09:56,508 --> 00:10:00,008
自信がないから描いてきたんだよ
I've drawn because I lacked confidence!

47
00:10:00,008 --> 00:10:01,508
あぁ 何回でも
Ah, no matter how many times...

48
00:10:01,508 --> 00:10:02,308
ほら 何回でも
Look, no matter how many times...

49
00:10:02,395 --> 00:10:06,595
何回でも 積み上げてきたことが武器になる
Everything I've built up, time and time again, will become my weapon.

50
00:10:06,595 --> 00:10:10,395
周りを見たって 誰と比べたって
Even if I look around, even if I compare myself to others,

51
00:10:10,395 --> 00:10:14,695
僕にしかできないことはなんだ
what is the one thing that only I can do?

52
00:10:14,695 --> 00:10:19,695
今でも自信なんか無い それでも
Even now, I don't have any confidence, but still...

53
00:10:19,695 --> 00:10:26,395
感じたことない気持ち 知らずにいた想い
Feelings I've never felt before, emotions I never knew existed,

54
00:10:26,395 --> 00:10:33,395
あの日踏み出して 初めて感じたこの痛みの全部
ever since I took that step that day, even all of this pain I felt for the first time...

55
00:10:33,395 --> 00:10:40,595
好きなものと向き合うことで 触れたまだ小さな光
By facing what I love, I touched a light that is still small.

56
00:10:40,595 --> 00:10:45,395
大丈夫 行こう あとは楽しむだけだ
It's okay, let's go, all that's left is to enjoy it.

57
00:10:47,695 --> 00:10:54,395
ああ すべてをかけて描く 自分にしか出せない色で
Ah, I'll paint with everything I've got, in a color only I can produce.

58
00:10:54,395 --> 00:11:01,895
朝も夜も走り続け 見つけ出した青い光
Running through both morning and night, the blue light I finally found.

59
00:11:02,395 --> 00:11:09,495
好きなものと向き合うこと 今だって怖いことだけど<,s:
Facing what I love is still a scary thing, even now, but...

60
00:11:09,495 --> 00:11:15,895
もう今は あの日の透明な僕じゃない
I am no longer the invisible me of that day.

61
00:11:15,895 --> 00:11:20,895
ありのままの かけがえのない僕だ
I am my irreplaceable, true self.

62
